          "prst": null,
          "flipH": null,
          "flipV": null,
          "text": "There is the one and only warm room in the housePolyisocyanurate insulation covers outside wall including single pane windows and single pane sliding glass doorsHas a massive gap at joint between stationary and moving parts which covered with duct tape to prevent wind from blowing in (see picture on right).For most of winter, I\u2019ve slept on the floor, my daughter on the top bunk and my 3 boys on the bottom bunk.When my dad visited for Christmas, he slept on the floor of the unheated living room in a 20 degree sleeping bag",
